{"version":1,"content":"<p>【18：56更新】粉嶺吉祥街8號欣翠花園發生男童疑猝死案件。</p><p>今早（17日）6時許，警方接獲一名男子報案，指其11歲兒子於單位房間內牀上昏迷，遂報警求助。</p><p>救護員接報到場，證實男童已當場死亡。</p><p>男童死因有待驗屍後確定，案件列作屍體發現。</p><p>據了解，男童有身體病記錄。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T11:19:14.293757+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T00:38:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T16:37:32.303283+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T11:17:34.483374+00:00","content_hash":"708d52aa73c2416b9462e344445f66e964b179d7504851b56f40305f826cf043","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}